            <hidden>false</hidden>
            <onlineHelp>If checked, then this method
will be executed during the 
owner object validation. The 
method must throw an exception 
if the owner object state is not valid. 
Note that the method is executed 
concurrently by a validation 
thread while the owner object 
is possibly accessed/modified 
by another thread.</onlineHelp>
