            <categoryName>Advanced</categoryName>
            <hidden>false</hidden>
            <onlineHelp>Whether the parameter should be bound to the first 
compatible object in the current display context. 
This object corresponds either to the object of the 
current form, to the object of one of the current 
ancestor forms, or to null if no compatible object is found. 
If multiple compatible objects are found, the one from 
the form highest in the hierarchy is returned.
Note that the parameter will be hidden if this option
is enabled.</onlineHelp>
